msgid "Status unknown: no recent probe results for the default proxy"
msgstr "状态未知：默认代理近期没有探测结果"

msgid "Default proxy available"
msgstr "默认代理可用"

#, python-format
msgid "Default proxy available; its %(n)d line is passing"
msgid_plural "Default proxy available; all %(n)d lines passing"
msgstr[0] "默认代理可用；全部 %(n)d 条线路正常"

msgid "Default proxy answering, but no line passes its probe"
msgstr "默认代理有响应，但没有线路通过探测"

msgid "Default proxy available on its last passing line, without a spare"
msgstr "默认代理仅剩一条正常线路可用，没有备用线路"

#, python-format
msgid "Default proxy available; %(n)d line not passing, failover working"
msgid_plural ""
"Default proxy available; %(n)d lines not passing, failover working"
msgstr[0] "默认代理可用；%(n)d 条线路未通过探测，故障切换正常"

msgid "Default proxy failing while its lines pass: the HA entry itself is down"
msgstr "默认代理故障，但线路正常：高可用入口本身不可用"

msgid "Default proxy failing: no line passes its probe"
msgstr "默认代理故障：没有线路通过探测"

msgid "Default proxy failing"
msgstr "默认代理故障"

msgid "HTTP entry failing, SOCKS5 still available"
msgstr "HTTP 入口故障，SOCKS5 仍可用"

msgid "SOCKS5 entry failing, HTTP still available"
msgstr "SOCKS5 入口故障，HTTP 仍可用"

msgid "HTTP entry available; SOCKS5 status unknown"
msgstr "HTTP 入口可用；SOCKS5 状态未知"

msgid "SOCKS5 entry available; HTTP status unknown"
msgstr "SOCKS5 入口可用；HTTP 状态未知"

msgid "HTTP entry failing; SOCKS5 status unknown"
msgstr "HTTP 入口故障；SOCKS5 状态未知"

msgid "SOCKS5 entry failing; HTTP status unknown"
msgstr "SOCKS5 入口故障；HTTP 状态未知"

msgctxt "incident component"
msgid "Default proxy (ha-general)"
msgstr "默认代理 (ha-general)"

msgctxt "incident component"
msgid "Admin entry (ha-all)"
msgstr "管理员入口 (ha-all)"

msgctxt "incident component"
msgid "Lines"
msgstr "线路"

msgctxt "incident component"
msgid "Monitoring"
msgstr "监控"

msgctxt "incident component"
msgid "Portal"
msgstr "门户"

msgctxt "incident state"
msgid "Investigating"
msgstr "调查中"

msgctxt "incident state"
msgid "Identified"
msgstr "已定位"

msgctxt "incident state"
msgid "Monitoring"
msgstr "观察中"

msgctxt "incident state"
msgid "Resolved"
msgstr "已恢复"

msgctxt "incident state"
msgid "Maintenance"
msgstr "维护"

msgid "My access"
msgstr "我的接入"

msgid "My proxy access"
msgstr "我的代理接入"

msgid ""
"Your proxy account, named after your Determined username, as the proxy "
"accounts file records it, and the entries it may use. Requests still waiting "
"are not shown. Passwords are never shown here."
msgstr ""
"你的代理账号（以你的 Determined 用户名命名）在代理账号文件中的记录，以及它可"
"以使用的入口。尚在等待中的请求不在此显示。这里从不显示密码。"

msgid ""
"Account information is unavailable right now. Try again later; the proxies "
"themselves are not affected."
msgstr "账号信息暂时不可用，请稍后再试；代理本身不受影响。"

msgid ""
"This account information has not been refreshed for a while and may be out "
"of date."
msgstr "账号信息已有一段时间没有更新，可能不是最新状态。"

msgid "Account"
msgstr "账号"

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s has no proxy account."
msgstr "%(name)s 没有代理账号。"

msgid ""
"To get one, ask an admin: the account is named after your Determined "
"username, and the admin gives you its password."
msgstr ""
"如需账号，请联系管理员：账号以你的 Determined 用户名命名，由管理员告诉你密"
"码。"

msgid ""
"Without an account you can use the public lines' own entries: they accept "
"anyone while raw auth is off."
msgstr ""
"没有账号时可以使用公共线路自己的入口：在线路认证 (raw auth) 关闭时，它们接受"
"任何人。"

#, python-format
msgid "Proxy access is <b>on</b> for the account <b>%(name)s</b>."
msgstr "账号 <b>%(name)s</b> 的代理访问已<b>开启</b>。"

msgid "This is an admin account: it may also use ha-all and the private lines."
msgstr "这是管理员账号：还可以使用 ha-all 和私有线路。"

#, python-format
msgid "Proxy access is <b>off</b> for the account <b>%(name)s</b>."
msgstr "账号 <b>%(name)s</b> 的代理访问已<b>关闭</b>。"

msgid "Every entry refuses it, the public lines' own entries included."
msgstr "所有入口都拒绝它，包括公共线路自己的入口。"

msgid ""
"ha-general, ha-all and the private lines refuse it. The public lines' own "
"entries still work for you: they need no account while raw auth is off."
msgstr ""
"ha-general、ha-all 和私有线路拒绝它。公共线路自己的入口仍可使用：线路认证 "
"(raw auth) 关闭时无需账号。"

msgid ""
"ha-general refuses it. The public lines' own entries still work for you: "
"they need no account while raw auth is off."
msgstr ""
"ha-general 拒绝它。公共线路自己的入口仍可使用：线路认证 (raw auth) 关闭时无需"
"账号。"

msgid ""
"Raw auth (accounts on the public lines' own entries) is off: a public line's "
"own entry accepts anyone, without an account, so turning an account off "
"stops only the HA entries and the private lines for it."
msgstr ""
"线路认证 (raw auth) 已关闭：公共线路自己的入口无需账号、接受任何人，所以关闭"
"一个账号的代理访问只会让高可用入口和私有线路拒绝它。"

msgid ""
"Raw auth (accounts on the public lines' own entries) is on: every entry "
"requires an enabled account."
msgstr "线路认证 (raw auth) 已开启：所有入口都需要已启用的账号。"

msgid ""
"Proxy access off is not a change to your cluster account: your Determined "
"login, jobs and files are not affected."
msgstr ""
"关闭代理访问不会改变你的集群账号：你的 Determined 登录、任务和文件都不受影"
"响。"

msgid ""
"The proxy admin flag is set per proxy account by the admins; it is not the "
"Determined admin role."
msgstr "代理管理员标记由管理员按代理账号设置，与 Determined 的管理员角色无关。"

msgid "Need an account or a new password? Ask an admin."
msgstr "需要账号或新密码？请联系管理员。"

msgid "Entries"
msgstr "入口"

msgid ""
"Every account may use ha-general and the public lines; admin accounts also "
"ha-all and the private lines. Same ports on both networks: the private "
"network from the nodes, the campus network from the login node."
msgstr ""
"每个账号都可以使用 ha-general 和公共线路；管理员账号还可以使用 ha-all 和私有"
"线路。两个网络的端口相同：节点上用内网地址，登录节点上用校园网地址。"

msgid "Default proxy"
msgstr "默认代理"

msgid "Admin entry"
msgstr "管理员入口"

msgid "Admins only"
msgstr "仅管理员"

msgid "No account needed"
msgstr "无需账号"

msgid "Usable"
msgstr "可用"

msgid "Needs an account"
msgstr "需要账号"

msgid "Proxy access off"
msgstr "代理访问已关闭"

msgid "HA over the public lines, with your account."
msgstr "在公共线路之间高可用切换，使用你的账号。"

msgid "HA over every line, with your admin account."
msgstr "在所有线路之间高可用切换，使用你的管理员账号。"

msgid "One line, no failover, with your account."
msgstr "单条线路，不切换，使用你的账号。"

msgid "One line, no failover, without an account."
msgstr "单条线路，不切换，无需账号。"

msgid "Private network"
msgstr "内网"

msgid "Campus network"
msgstr "校园网"

msgid "Ports not published"
msgstr "端口未发布"

msgid "No entries"
msgstr "没有入口"

msgid "Client settings"
msgstr "客户端设置"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"For the default proxy ha-general. Replace %(placeholder)s with your "
"account's password; socks5h lets the proxy resolve names."
msgstr ""
"适用于默认代理 ha-general。把 %(placeholder)s 换成你账号的密码；socks5h 表示"
"由代理解析域名。"

msgid "Network"
msgstr "网络"

msgid ""
"Keep the password to yourself: set it in your own shell profile or task "
"environment, never in images, notebooks, shared task templates or "
"repositories. If it leaks, ask an admin for a new one."
msgstr ""
"请自行保管密码：只写在自己的 shell 配置或任务环境中，不要写进镜像、notebook、"
"共享的任务模板或代码仓库。如有泄露，请联系管理员更换。"

msgid "Private network (the nodes)"
msgstr "内网（节点）"

msgid "Campus network (the login node)"
msgstr "校园网（登录节点）"

msgid "Environment variables"
msgstr "环境变量"

msgid "curl over HTTP"
msgstr "curl，HTTP"

msgid "curl over SOCKS5 (socks5h)"
msgstr "curl，SOCKS5 (socks5h)"

msgid "git, for GitHub over HTTPS"
msgstr "git，经 HTTPS 访问 GitHub"

msgid "Copied"
msgstr "已复制"

msgid "Copy"
msgstr "复制"

msgid "Client settings appear here once you have a proxy account."
msgstr "有代理账号后，这里会显示客户端设置。"

msgid "Client settings appear here while proxy access is on."
msgstr "代理访问开启时，这里会显示客户端设置。"

msgid "CVGL Proxy"
msgstr "CVGL 代理"

msgid "Skip to content"
msgstr "跳到正文"

msgid "Proxy status and access"
msgstr "代理状态与接入"

msgid "Main"
msgstr "主导航"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "服务状态"

msgid "My usage"
msgstr "我的流量"

msgid "Language"
msgstr "语言"

#, python-format
msgid "Signed in as <b>%(name)s</b>"
msgstr "已登录：<b>%(name)s</b>"

msgid "Read from Determined at sign-in"
msgstr "登录时从 Determined 读取"

msgid "Determined admin"
msgstr "Determined 管理员"

msgid "Sign out"
msgstr "退出"

msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "登录"

msgid ""
"Probe results from Prometheus. Account information from the proxy accounts "
"file, refreshed at least every 5 minutes."
msgstr ""
"探测结果来自 Prometheus；账号信息来自代理账号文件，至少每 5 分钟刷新一次。"

msgid "Proxy Availability in Grafana"
msgstr "Grafana：代理可用性"

msgid "Proxy Usage in Grafana"
msgstr "Grafana：代理流量"

msgid "Sign in with your Determined login"
msgstr "用 Determined 账号登录"

msgid ""
"The portal checks your username and password once with the Determined master "
"and keeps neither the password nor the master's token."
msgstr ""
"门户只向 Determined master 校验一次用户名和密码，不保存密码，也不保存 master "
"的令牌。"

msgid "Username"
msgstr "用户名"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "密码"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"You stay signed in for %(hours)s hours. Your Determined admin flag is read "
"at sign-in: sign in again after it changes."
msgstr ""
"登录状态保持 %(hours)s 小时。Determined 管理员标记在登录时读取：标记变化后请"
"重新登录。"

msgid "Passing"
msgstr "正常"

msgid "Failing"
msgstr "故障"

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "未知"

msgid "Service health"
msgstr "服务健康"

msgid "Proxy status"
msgstr "代理服务状态"

msgid ""
"Whether requests get through the HA entries and each line, from probes every "
"30 seconds. The status of an entry is not whether your account may use it: "
"see My access."
msgstr ""
"根据每 30 秒一次的探测，显示请求能否通过高可用入口和各条线路。入口的状态不代"
"表你的账号可以使用它：请看“我的接入”。"

msgid "Last check"
msgstr "最近检查"

msgid "Monitoring data is unavailable, so every status is unknown."
msgstr "监控数据不可用，所有状态均为未知。"

msgid ""
"The default proxy ha-general sends each new connection to a passing public "
"line; open connections stay on their line."
msgstr ""
"默认代理 ha-general 把每个新连接发往一条正常的公共线路；已建立的连接留在原线"
"路上。"

msgid "public lines passing"
msgstr "公共线路正常"

msgid "Default proxy · HTTP"
msgstr "默认代理 · HTTP"

msgid "24 h success"
msgstr "24 小时成功率"

msgid "coverage"
msgstr "覆盖率"

msgid "Default proxy · SOCKS5"
msgstr "默认代理 · SOCKS5"

msgid "Lines of the default proxy"
msgstr "默认代理的线路"

msgid "passing / configured"
msgstr "正常 / 已配置"

#, python-format
msgid "Unknown when older than %(s)s s"
msgstr "超过 %(s)s 秒即为未知"

msgid ""
"The HA entries keep one address and choose a passing line for each new "
"connection."
msgstr "高可用入口地址固定，为每个新连接选择一条正常的线路。"

msgid "Over the public lines, for every proxy account"
msgstr "在公共线路之间切换，所有代理账号可用"

msgid "Over every line, public and private, for admin accounts"
msgstr "在所有公共和私有线路之间切换，仅管理员账号可用"

#, python-format
msgid "%(passing)s of %(configured)s lines passing"
msgstr "%(configured)s 条线路中 %(passing)s 条正常"

msgid "Past 30 days"
msgstr "过去 30 天"

msgid ""
"The default proxy's probe success rate per 24 hours, HTTP and SOCKS5, the "
"worse of the two. A day with probe results for less than half of it is grey."
msgstr ""
"默认代理每 24 小时的探测成功率，取 HTTP 和 SOCKS5 中较差的一个。探测结果不足"
"半天的日子显示为灰色。"

msgid "no probe results"
msgstr "没有探测结果"

msgid "success"
msgstr "成功率"

msgid "Degraded"
msgstr "部分异常"

msgid "30 days ago"
msgstr "30 天前"

msgid "Unknown or too little data"
msgstr "未知或数据不足"

msgid "Now"
msgstr "现在"

msgid "Lines"
msgstr "线路"

msgid ""
"Each line probed through its own entry. A line's own entry has no failover: "
"when it fails, use the default proxy."
msgstr ""
"每条线路都通过它自己的入口探测。线路自己的入口没有故障切换：线路故障时请使用"
"默认代理。"

msgid "Line"
msgstr "线路"

msgid "Duration"
msgstr "耗时"

msgid "Coverage"
msgstr "覆盖率"

msgid "Public lines"
msgstr "公共线路"

msgid "Private lines"
msgstr "私有线路"

msgid "No line results"
msgstr "没有线路结果"

msgid "Duration and 24 h success: HTTP / SOCKS5."
msgstr "耗时和 24 小时成功率：HTTP / SOCKS5。"

msgid "Duration, coverage and last check: on a wider screen."
msgstr "耗时、覆盖率和最近检查：请在更宽的屏幕上查看。"

msgid "Incidents"
msgstr "事件"

msgid "Notices from the admins about outages and maintenance."
msgstr "管理员发布的故障和维护通知。"

msgid "No incidents in the last 30 days"
msgstr "过去 30 天没有事件"

msgid "Reading the status"
msgstr "如何理解状态"

msgid "What the probes show, and what they do not."
msgstr "探测能说明什么，不能说明什么。"

msgid "The service works but you cannot connect"
msgstr "服务正常但你无法连接"

msgid ""
"Check My access: whether you have an account, whether its proxy access is "
"on, and the address for your network. The probes run on the supplementary "
"services VM and do not cover the way from your machine to it."
msgstr ""
"请查看“我的接入”：你是否有账号、代理访问是否开启，以及你所在网络的地址。探测"
"在附属服务虚拟机上运行，不覆盖从你的机器到它的网络路径。"

msgid "Failover"
msgstr "故障切换"

msgid ""
"An HA entry chooses a passing line for each new connection, within about 15 "
"seconds of a line failing. Open downloads, SSH sessions and WebSockets stay "
"on their line and break with it; the client has to retry."
msgstr ""
"线路故障后约 15 秒内，高可用入口会为新连接选择正常的线路。已建立的下载、SSH "
"会话和 WebSocket 留在原线路上，会随之中断，需要客户端重试。"

msgid ""
"No probe result in the last 90 seconds. An older result is never shown in "
"its place."
msgstr "最近 90 秒内没有探测结果；不会用更早的结果代替。"

msgid "My proxy usage"
msgstr "我的代理流量"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Observed traffic of the account %(name)s, counted where you enter the "
"proxies: the HA entries, and a line's own entry when it requires accounts. "
"Traffic through a line's own entry without an account is counted under no "
"user."
msgstr ""
"账号 %(name)s 的观测流量，按你接入代理的入口计数：高可用入口，以及需要账号时"
"线路自己的入口。不带账号经线路自己的入口产生的流量不计入任何用户。"

msgid ""
"Usage data is unavailable right now: Prometheus did not answer. Try again "
"later."
msgstr "流量数据暂时不可用：Prometheus 没有响应，请稍后再试。"

msgid "Observed totals"
msgstr "观测总量"

msgid ""
"Download and upload through the proxies over the last 24 hours, 7 days and "
"30 days."
msgstr "最近 24 小时、7 天和 30 天经代理的下载和上传流量。"

msgid "Last 24 hours"
msgstr "最近 24 小时"

msgid "Last 7 days"
msgstr "最近 7 天"

msgid "Last 30 days"
msgstr "最近 30 天"

msgid "Download"
msgstr "下载"

msgid "Upload"
msgstr "上传"

msgid "No traffic observed"
msgstr "未观测到流量"

msgid "Trend"
msgstr "趋势"

msgid ""
"Download and upload per hour (24 hours), per 6 hours (7 days) and per day "
"(30 days)."
msgstr "下载和上传：每小时（24 小时）、每 6 小时（7 天）、每天（30 天）。"

msgid "Range"
msgstr "时间范围"

msgid "24 hours"
msgstr "24 小时"

msgid "7 days"
msgstr "7 天"

msgid "30 days"
msgstr "30 天"

#, python-format
msgid "Traffic per bucket; the highest bucket is %(peak)s."
msgstr "每个时间段的流量；最高的时间段为 %(peak)s。"

#, python-format
msgid "Highest bar: %(peak)s"
msgstr "最高：%(peak)s"

msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

msgid ""
"These are observed totals, not a bill or a quota. They include traffic to "
"private addresses and destinations in China. Counters restart when a proxy "
"restarts, as after an account change, so a little traffic before a restart "
"can be missing, and a total built from few samples can read high."
msgstr ""
"这些是观测总量，不是账单或配额，包括访问内网和国内目标的流量。代理重启时（例"
"如账号变更后）计数器归零，因此重启前的少量流量可能缺失，样本很少时的总量可能"
"偏高。"

msgid "Only the signed-in user's own usage is shown."
msgstr "这里只显示当前登录用户自己的流量。"

#, python-format
msgid "%(n)d s ago"
msgstr "%(n)d 秒前"

#, python-format
msgid "%(n)d min ago"
msgstr "%(n)d 分钟前"

#, python-format
msgid "%(n)d h ago"
msgstr "%(n)d 小时前"

#, python-format
msgid "%(n)d days ago"
msgstr "%(n)d 天前"

msgid "Enter your Determined username and password."
msgstr "请输入 Determined 用户名和密码。"

#, python-format
msgid "Too many failed sign-ins. Try again in %(n)d minute."
msgid_plural "Too many failed sign-ins. Try again in %(n)d minutes."
msgstr[0] "登录失败次数过多，请 %(n)d 分钟后再试。"

msgid ""
"The Determined master cannot check your sign-in right now. Try again later."
msgstr "Determined master 暂时无法校验登录，请稍后再试。"

msgid "This Determined account is deactivated."
msgstr "这个 Determined 账号已停用。"

msgid "Wrong username or password."
msgstr "用户名或密码错误。"
